# 8. DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT

Use private Cloudflare R2 storage.

Features:

- Multiple file uploads.
- File metadata.
- Document categories.
- Required-document checklist.
- File format restrictions.
- Configurable file-size restrictions.
- Document versioning.
- Document verification.
- Rejection reason.
- Resubmission.
- Expiry metadata when applicable.
- Document download history.

Security:

- Never make identity documents publicly accessible.
- Generate short-lived signed download links after authorization.
- Validate actual file content and MIME type.
- Generate unpredictable object keys.
- Prevent path traversal.
- Apply upload limits.
- Protect against malicious files.
- Never trust filenames or extensions.
- Avoid logging document contents or sensitive identity values.
- Add access audit logs.
- Apply appropriate retention and deletion policies.

Only authorized users should access the documents required for their workflow.

